    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d304">

                <pb facs="0369" n="1103" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1103"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Breckinridge.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-12"><hi rendition="#italic">October 12,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 126.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your No. 144, of the 28th
                    ultimo, reporting detention at Nieszawa, government of Warsaw, of Anton
                    Yablkowski, claiming to be an American citizen, on charges so far not
                    ascertained.</p>
                <p>I inclose copy of the application made to this Department by Anton Yablkowski on
                    which passport No. 18144 was issued. You will observe that the applicant
                    represented that he was born in Prussia.</p>
                <p>If the question of the validity of our passport should be raised, you will find
                    correspondence on the subject printed in <ref target="frus:frus1893/pg_15"
                        >Foreign Relations, 1893, pages 15</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus:frus1893/pg_23">23</ref>, and in <ref
                        target="frus:frus1894/pg_36">Foreign Relations, 1894, pages 36</ref> to <ref
                        target="frus:frus1894/pg_47">47</ref>, which may be of service to you.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
